{0 Pgn_to_tex}

[Pgn_to_tex] converts chess games written in PGN to LaTeX fragments. Move
numbers, moves, comments, variations, NAGs, and optional diagrams of selected
positions are rendered into text suitable for inclusion in a larger LaTeX
document.

{1 Quick start}

{[
  let tex = Pgn_to_tex.to_tex "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3"
]}

Pass [~clock:true] to render clock annotations. Pass [~diagram_data] to select
positions for diagrams; build a selection with
{!Pgn_to_tex.parse_diagrams_json} or use {!Pgn_to_tex.empty_diagrams} to
explicitly request a game with no diagrams.

{1 API}

{!modules:Pgn_to_tex}
